# ===== CRITICAL: private keys =====
# GitHub push protection BLOCKS pushes that contain private keys.
# The app runs HTTP-only without them (Android walkers work fine);
# regenerate with gen_cert.sh (macOS/Linux) or gen_cert.bat (Windows).
cert.pem
key.pem

